Subject: [PATCH 2/5] feat(03-40): add the rag:embedding CLI for the gated
 pointer flip

- status, activate, rollback and set-status over profile-ops, set-status never takes active
- the gate's refusal is printed by name with its detail and the exit code is non-zero
- completeness per halfvec profile through the re-embed count; the legacy column is counted by the gate
- the operator is warned when RAG_EMBEDDING_PROFILES is off

